            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.1.2+MAL.1.3+MAL.1.4+MAL.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1:2-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kud icung i akarayo, kara juthum woko dhanu pare m’uboth; man kud wucib dhanu pare m’udong’ i ceng’ mi masendi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ceng’ pa Yehova ni ceng’ni wi thek ceke: calu itimo, ebitimbre iri; cul peri bidwog i wii giri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum calu wumadhu wi got para ma leng’, thek ceke bimadhu kumeca thiri thiri; eyo, gibimadhu, gibimwonyo, man gibibedo calu gimbe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i got Sayuni ju m’uboth bibedo nuti, man ebibedo leng’; man ot pa Yakobo bimwonyo piny migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ot pa Yakobo bibedo ni mac, man ot pa Yusuf ni lebmac, ot pa Esau de ni soka, man gibiliel i kindgi, e gibiwang’ugi; man ng’atu moko mbe ma bidong’ ni ot pa Esau; kum Yehova yero maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ju ma yor ariwa ma piny bimwonyo got mir Esau, man ju mi poga bimwonyo Jufilisti; man gibimwonyo podho pa Efraim, man podho mi Samaria; man Benyamin bimwonyo Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’eca mir udul maeni ni nyithindho mir Israel, ma gini i kind Jukanani, gibimwonyo cil kum Zarefath; man ng’eca mi Yerusalem, ma gini i Sefarad, gibimwonyo adhura ma yor ariwa ma piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jubodh biidho malu wi got Sayuni kara gipok lembe mi got mir Esau; e ker bibedo pa Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
